			"date": "2026-01-22T16:28:07.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Don’t forget the parts that are like showing up at a jobsite and doing a bunch of work for free, all in the hope that some future work might actually be funded.</p>",
